title: Verclsid COM Object Approval Abuse
id: 9c1e09be-ba5d-4766-8d3a-4049508aa954
status: experimental
description: Detects verclsid.exe invoked with /S /C and a CLSID, a signed LOLBin that can be abused to instantiate and execute a COM object, proxying code execution past some controls.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/012/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\verclsid.exe'
    CommandLine|contains: '/C'
    CommandLine|contains: '{'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Shell extension verification (normally parented by explorer)
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1218.012
